220:5. **Codex 无额度时 (Q-1 fallback)**:`DEFERRED_CODEX_REVIEW.md` + `reviewer_status=deferred_due_to_codex_unavailable`,**严禁** 假装降级到 deepseek-reviewer 审 deepseek-planner (丧失异构底线)。正确路径见 §0.7.2 7 步路径(DEFERRED → tester first → developer → tester → reviewer [code review 异构底线宽松] → ACCEPTANCE)。
231:| `DEFERRED_due_to_codex_unavailable` | Codex 卡死 / 无额度,已写 `DEFERRED_CODEX_REVIEW.md` | 跳过 PLAN_REVIEW 阶段,直接派 `[tester:minimax]` 写 TEST_TARGET.md (TDD 头) → developer → tester → reviewer (异构底线对 code review 工位宽松,codex / deepseek-reviewer 都可以) → ACCEPTANCE |
